# Measured off art/back.jpg (versioning, plate 1, big box PC, nothing
# lettered on it), as fractions of its width (728px): no frame on the
# plate, the guild seal with the quill ghosted between 0.32 and 0.80 of
# the width (0.64–0.87 of the width down, centre at 0.53 of the height —
# asked at 0.60), the darker band from 1.276 (0.907 of the height) —
# 0.13 tall, short like ash's and version_manager's, so the install
# lozenge sits beside the name in one row. A rim 3px wide and a step
# lighter runs along the left, top and bottom edges. The screenshots
# take the top of the face at their own 600:520; the strip is the
# pattern's defaults from NAME_Y. The frame rule is the big box's gilt;
# the accent is the gold of the front's lettering and lantern (#D5AA5E,
# sampled off art/hero.jpg), since its verdigris does not read on the
# violet.
FRAMES="0.075,0.07,0.40,0.347 0.525,0.07,0.40,0.347"
FRAME_RULE="#1E1024,6,#D5AA5E,2"
CAPTION_Y=0.44
HEAD_Y=0.505
PANEL=""
BLURB_Y=0.58
FEAT_Y=0.785
QUOTE_Y=0.99
F_QUOTE=Utopia-Italic
REQ_Y=1.095
NAME_Y=1.30
INSTALL_ROW=beside
# The Noto serif runs the name wide: a step smaller and tracked
# tighter, as on version_manager, or the row is 0.86 of the width.
NAME_POINT=0.019
NAME_KERN=0.001
ERA=bigbox
ACCENT="#D5AA5E"
